  "provenance": "Task-owned copy of the fixed-second native reference. In Numbers, select C2:D8 on each of the three sheets, retain custom abbreviated units and enable milliseconds; save locally. Export one XLSX sheet per Numbers sheet without a summary and a full-sheet PDF with each sheet on one page. Original second reference remains unchanged.",
  "nativeUi": {
    "initialNumbersRunning": false,
