  },
  "qualification": [
    "Strict five-field selected duration formats for hour/millisecond, minute/millisecond and second/millisecond. All 42 typed raw-second caches and 21 C+C formulas are independently decoded through numbers-parser 4.19.0 and paired with native XLSX day serials and codes.",
    "Shared display expectations are calculated independently from decoded seconds by fixed millisecond precision and elapsed unit decomposition. They qualify the declared XLSX code contract; they are not native Excel appearance evidence.",
    "Native PDF duration cells are independently extracted with pdfplumber and all three pages are visually inspected. Native Numbers uses separate ms labels; native XLSX export uses fractional seconds with a terminal literal space.",
    "Saved/reopened source conversion, source identity, formula recalculation and complete editable-to-PDF stages are checked through public owners."
  ],
  "knownLimits": [
    "Native Numbers separate ms labels differ from destination three-digit fractional-second text. Preserve explicit duration display approximation. Additional fractional precision, automatic units, millisecond-only totals, other ranges/label styles and locales remain unqualified.",
    "Native Excel appearance for this millisecond reference has not been assessed. Negative elapsed display and exact geometry remain separate acceptance requirements.",
    "pdfplumber substitutes a hyphen for the ti ligature in native PDF labels; numeric duration cells extract correctly and visual inspection verifies the labels.",
    "Native PDF uses host Calibri; composed output reports substitution to PDF Helvetica with the recorded caller Carlito fallback.",
    "Composed width pagination has six pages versus three native positioned-sheet pages. Every populated row and formula-result cell is retained; this does not establish exact geometry or typography."
  ],
